# HATC Website

Before planning, designing or changing code, read `docs/HATC_PROJECT_BRIEF.md`,
`docs/HATC_FACTS.md`, `docs/WEBSITE_STRUCTURE.md` and `docs/DESIGN_DIRECTION.md`.

## Facts

- `docs/HATC_FACTS.md` is the only approved source of company facts.
- Never invent company facts, licences, membership info, statistics, products,
  testimonials or trading conditions. Mark any unconfirmed fact for review and ask.
- Do not rewrite approved Chinese copy unless requested.
- 2026-08-07 (owner): HATC's business includes **gold CFD (差價合約)** in addition
  to the physical-metal products. CFD is an approved business line; do NOT invent
  its trading conditions (leverage, spreads, lots, fees, platform) — those remain
  owner-supplied only. See `docs/HATC_FACTS.md` → "CFD business".

