### CMS-first content architecture (owner decision 2026-08-10)

Owner pivoted to **CMS-first, broad scope**: pause building NEW pages; build the
editorial CMS content model first, then resume pages wiring each editorial block to
CMS. Full plan + phases in `docs/HANDOFF.md` (第十九輪, planning). Key rules:

- **Content layering (do NOT collapse these):**
  1. **Facts** → `HATC_FACTS.md` only. NOT owner-freely-editable in the CMS
     (governance). Approved trading conditions (gold 27 / silver 30 / 1:100) stay in
     code (`products/tradingConditions.ts`) as source of truth.
  2. **Operational links** → Payload `SiteSettings` global (already done).
  3. **Editorial / marketing content** (owner-editable) → CMS collections/globals:
     FAQ, news/activities, academy articles, page hero/section marketing copy,
     sample trading-condition display tables.
  4. **UI structural strings** (nav, button labels, section kickers, form labels,
     metadata templates) → stay in `src/messages/*` i18n. Do NOT CMS-ify every
     micro-string (over-engineering; needs dev/QA anyway).
- **Reader pattern = DB→fallback (mandatory).** Every CMS reader mirrors
  `lib/siteSettings.ts` / `lib/faqs.ts` / `lib/homeActivities.ts`: read Payload when
  `DATABASE_URI` is set, else fall back. This keeps local/preview builds working AND
  keeps pages **SSG**. i18n messages are the **default/seed + fallback** for each CMS
  type that has approved seeds — do NOT delete them when adding CMS. **Exception
  (news/activities):** no fabricated activity seeds; empty → neutral empty UI via
  `news.*` chrome only.
- **Refresh = SSG + on-demand revalidation.** Tag reads and revalidate via Payload
  `afterChange`/`afterDelete` hooks (`revalidateTag(tag, 'max')`/`revalidatePath`). No full SSR.
- **DRY infra (Phase 0 done, 2026-08-10):** `src/lib/payload.ts` (`getPayloadClient()` +
  `hasDb()`), `src/lib/cacheTags.ts`, `src/lib/revalidateContent.ts`; readers use
  `unstable_cache` + tags. Refactored `siteSettings` / `homeActivities`.
- **Phase 1 FAQ (done, 2026-08-10):** `Faqs` collection + `lib/faqs.ts` (`getFaqs`);
  `/trading` `TradingFaq` reads CMS, fallback `trading.faq.items`; FAQ answers = textarea.
- **Phase 2 news/activities (done, 2026-08-10):** Reuses `HomeActivities` + `getHomeActivities`;
  homepage `LatestNews` + `/news` list; empty → neutral i18n UI (`news.*`), **no fabricated
  activity seeds**; revalidate tag + `/${locale}` + `/${locale}/news`.
- **Phase 3 AcademyArticles (done, 2026-08-10):** Collection `academy-articles` +
 `lib/academyArticles.ts`（DB→i18n fallback `home.goldAcademy.articles` a1–a3，**seeds kept**）；
 homepage `Academy` + `/academy` list; revalidate tag + home + `/academy`.
 **Detail `/academy/[slug]` (done, 第二十六輪):** `getAcademyArticleBySlug` + Lexical
 `RichText`; sitemap includes article paths; seed/no-body → excerpt-only Lexical
 (no invented full articles).
- **Phase 4 marketing globals + sample tables (done, 2026-08-10):** Globals
  `home-page` / `trading-page` / `about-page` / `products-page`（只開 hero／區塊 intro／CTA；
